  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "书和装饰品摆放在一张茶几上，后面是蓝色沙发和蓝色靠垫。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "80395781",
    "80395743",
    "30343006"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/18/6f/186fcd5d44359483a8fce73a2485d217.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
